# Allowlist: the build context is only what the Dockerfile copies (see docs/en-US/docker.md).
# Everything else (node_modules, target/, *.db, .git, local designs) stays out of the context.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/core/
!web-legacy/
!apps/web/
!crates/render/
!crates/sync/
!server/

# Build outputs and local state that may exist inside the allowed folders.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
web-legacy/src/wasm/
apps/web/src/wasm/
crates/render/target/
crates/sync/target/
crates/sync/tests/
server/bin/
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
packages/core/test/
server/**/*_test.go
server/**/testdata/
